✅ Keyword rendering is XSS-safe
✅ Strength/weakness rendering is XSS-safe
✅ Single storage source (`localStorage`)
✅ Ready for future ATS auto-fill from Resume Builder
✅ No architectural rewrite required

The file would move from roughly **8.5/10 → 9.2/10** while keeping the existing structure intact.
